        "body": "## What's Changed\n* docs: list the MCP directories and the DeepSeek Harness plugin by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/267\n* ci: build a Docker tag that is not PEP 440 as a local version by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/273\n* query: answer a series printed in two units in one unit (#271) by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/272\n* code_exec: say why there is nothing to compute on by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/274\n* upload: say a local model is still loading, in the page's language by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/276\n* feat(agent): one compact table per indicator in a mixed result by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/269\n* query: name a series without a LOINC display in every view by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/270\n* query: name each series once and write each number one way by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/278\n* upload: a deleted upload stays deleted, a file reads processing by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/279\n* extraction: a scanner's settings and a history heading are no reading by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/280\n* journal: name a LOINC-coded entry in the reader's language by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/265\n* accounts: a reinstall's first account takes no old token by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/282\n* release: 1.6.1 by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/283\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/compare/1.6.0...1.6.1",
