        "body": "## What's Changed\n* frontend: code_exec reads as a calculation; the indicator drawer's table scrolls on its own by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/230\n* llm: an empty completion is no answer, not an AttributeError by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/242\n* personal MCP links: document one URL per record; activation revokes too by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/243\n* citations: take cited ids as a JSON list, not a comma string by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/247\n* units: L/L is a volume fraction, 100 % of one by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/248\n* docs: how a reading becomes comparable; the guides in Japanese by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/228\n* fix(import): find the Apple Health export by its HealthData root by @mayuriphad in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/249\n* frontend: sync the web client from mirobody-web 3b4bcfd by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/253\n* frontend: sync the web client from mirobody-web 985f3c2 by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/254\n* frontend: load the entry chunk the 985f3c2 sync renamed by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/255\n* resolver: a name with 测定 or a flag after it codes like the bare name by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/252\n* catalog: every series a decoder writes declares a daily statistic by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/250\n* standardize: a LOINC code's name in Chinese for Chinese readers (#231) by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/256\n* frontend: an MCP link for each record you can read by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/257\n* apple: count an imported reading on its record's own day by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/260\n* fix: prefer fresh Apple Health transport data for a day by @mvanhorn in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/261\n* account merge: move a family member's MCP link to the kept account by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/258\n* names: a plain name and what a test measures, in the reader's language (#231) by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/259\n* observations: a name that folds to nothing is no name by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/251\n* frontend: names for people, facets in the drawer, a dark palette by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/262\n* contracts: stop naming two collect modules that no longer exist by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/263\n* fix: preserve Apple daily figures during re-import recalculation by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/266\n* release: 1.6.0 by @saltyfishtree in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/264\n\n## New Contributors\n* @mayuriphad made their first contribution in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/249\n* @mvanhorn made their first contribution in https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/pull/261\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thetahealth/mirobody/compare/1.5.10...1.6.0",
